{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Support my work and get more weapons to play with:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275900/extras/Supporter_Pack_MachineGun.png?t=1744199419\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Machine Gun has a high rate of fire at the cost of accuracy. 20-round magazine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275900/extras/Supporter_Pack_Carbine.png?t=1744199419\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Carbine combines accuracy with high Focus (zoom) allowing for some sniper action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275900/extras/Supporter_Pack_CoachGun.png?t=1744199419\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Coach Gun causes mayhem at close range.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275900/extras/Supporter_Pack_Bow.png?t=1744199419\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Bow is difficult to master but very satisfying when you can.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3275900?t=1744199419","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3275900?t=1744199419","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275900/5f905a9752e2b827ee88f06241332429eba64fac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744199419","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275900/5f905a9752e2b827ee88f06241332429eba64fac/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744199419","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Blood effects when hitting enemies that splatters the enviroment. Bullet wounds on bodies. All can be disabled."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Support my work and get more weapons to play with:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275900/extras/Supporter_Pack_MachineGun.png?t=1744199419\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Machine Gun has a high rate of fire at the cost of accuracy. 20-round magazine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275900/extras/Supporter_Pack_Carbine.png?t=1744199419\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Carbine combines accuracy with high Focus (zoom) allowing for some sniper action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275900/extras/Supporter_Pack_CoachGun.png?t=1744199419\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Coach Gun causes mayhem at close range.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275900/extras/Supporter_Pack_Bow.png?t=1744199419\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Bow is difficult to master but very satisfying when you can.</p>","developers":["Stolpskott Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2835310","name":"Sharpshooter"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3275900/header.jpg?t=1744199419","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257113553,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113553/movie480.mp4?t=1744199411","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113553/movie_max.mp4?t=174419